<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Join Whisperwell</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-cream font-sans text-ink">
  <header class="border-b-2 border-ink/10 bg-cream/95">
    <nav class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-5 py-5 lg:px-8">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="grid h-10 w-10 rotate-3 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink text-xl text-mint shadow-[4px_4px_0_#ff6b5f]">✦</span><span class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight">Whisperwell</span></a>
      <a href="/log-in" class="rounded-full border-2 border-ink px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold transition hover:bg-ink hover:text-white">Already a member?</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 py-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <section class="self-center">
      <p class="mb-5 inline-flex rounded-full bg-mint px-4 py-2 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Pull up a chair</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl leading-tight sm:text-6xl">Make room for your <span class="text-coral">voice.</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">Create your Whisperwell account and leave thoughts for the clubhouse to discover. Your membership starts here—your private-club access comes later.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink/10 bg-lilac/50 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-ink/70"><strong class="text-ink">A small promise:</strong> your password is securely hashed before it is saved, and new accounts begin as non-members.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-3xl border-2 border-ink/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-[8px_8px_0_#e6ddff] sm:p-9">
      <div class="mb-8"><p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-coral">New account</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl">Join the well</h2></div>
      <% if (typeof errors !== 'undefined' && errors.length) { %>
        <div class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-coral/40 bg-coral/10 p-4 text-sm" role="alert"><p class="font-bold">Please check the following:</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5"><% errors.forEach((error) => { %><li><%= error.msg || error %></li><% }) %></ul></div>
      <% } %>
      <form action="/sign-up" method="POST" class="space-y-5">
        <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div><label for="first_name" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">First name</label><input id="first_name" name="first_name" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required maxlength="50" value="<%= typeof formData !== 'undefined' ? (formData.first_name || '') : '' %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 outline-none transition placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="Ada"></div>
          <div><label for="last_name" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">Last name</label><input id="last_name" name="last_name" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" required maxlength="50" value="<%= typeof formData !== 'undefined' ? (formData.last_name || '') : '' %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 outline-none transition placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="Lovelace"></div>
        </div>
        <div><label for="email" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">Email address</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="255" value="<%= typeof formData !== 'undefined' ? (formData.email || '') : '' %>" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 outline-none transition placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="you@example.com"></div>
        <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div><label for="password" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">Password</label><input id="password" name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="8" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 outline-none transition placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="At least 8 characters"></div>
          <div><label for="confirmPassword" class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold">Confirm password</label><input id="confirmPassword" name="confirmPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" required minlength="8" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink/15 bg-cream px-4 py-3 outline-none transition placeholder:text-ink/35 focus:border-coral focus:ring-4 focus:ring-coral/10" placeholder="Repeat your password"></div>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-xl bg-ink px-5 py-3.5 font-bold text-white shadow-[4px_4px_0_#ff6b5f] transition hover:translate-x-0.5 hover:translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-none">Create my account <span class="ml-1">↗</span></button>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-ink/55">By joining, you agree to keep the clubhouse kind and curious.</p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
